WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.940
The Digital World,

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.080
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.530
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:18.300
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.010
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.710
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.760
The Death General Splashmon's trap

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.760
awaited us in the fourth 
Kingdom, Cyber Land.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.000
His nasty attacks that tried to 
make us lose trust in each other

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.030
pushed us to the brink of crisis.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:07.310
But our bonds of faith in each other 
couldn't be broken by Splashmon.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.630
We crushed the Water Tiger,

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.560
and now three Kingdoms remain!

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.090
We've covered more than 
half of the seven Kingdoms.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.180
Look.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:37.370
So that's the Great Bagra Palace?

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.000
We're getting close 
to the final showdown.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.260
It won't be that easy.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.920
That fog surrounding it 
like an evil miasma

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.610
is growing thicker and stronger.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.930
And the color of the Code Crown

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.450
looks darker than it did before.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.780
We've been defeating Death Generals,

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.960
yet the evil power isn't weakening. 
What could it mean?

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.300
It means we'd better hurry, at any rate.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.730
Come on, time to bust 
into a new Kingdom!

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.750
What is this?

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.790
It's so salty!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.950
Is this sea water?

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.780
It appears to be.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.480
It's a golden sea.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.920
An ocean Kingdom now, huh?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:36.940
<b>The Merry Pirates Appear!</b>

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:36.940
<b>Set Sail for Gold Land!!</b>

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:34.700
The Merry Pirates Appear! 
Set Sail for Gold Land!!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.740
This is Deckerdramon Float Mode.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.430
Come on, everyone get on my back.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.750
You're a big help! 
Thanks, Deckerdramon!

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.130
If only Kiriha were so 
openly gracious as you.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.310
You're strong,

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.530
but I don't like to use you 
because you talk too much.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.900
My master is always like this.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.700
Well then, off we go, everyone!

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.290
What an awesome view!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.710
Are all those islands made of gold?!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.270
What is it, Ballistamon?

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.160
Something feels strange.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.860
Look. That's odd.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:45.850
Usually, there's an enemy flag 
in the area of the Code Crown

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.000
that serves as the path 
to the next Kingdom.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.170
You're right, I don't 
see one anywhere...

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.170
What's going on, Deckerdramon?

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.080
The currents have suddenly 
changed direction!

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.540
What is this?!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.170
It's a tremendous whirlpool!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.780
Even I can't get across it!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.920
No way!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.560
Here comes this Kingdom's Death General!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.180
I-It's a pirate ship!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:27.600
Welcome to the golden sea, Gold Land!

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.170
I am one of the Bagra 
Army's seven Generals,

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.040
Olegmon the Gold Thief.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.150
Olegmon?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:36.450
Looks like we'll be facing 
another tough one.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.480
We're more than a match for him!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.610
You're full of youthful vigor, 
aren't you? I welcome you.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.790
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.490
What the heck is that?

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.650
It's the magic incantation 
of this Kingdom

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.940
that makes anyone who 
hears it bow to me.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.710
You will all recite it as well,

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:57.850
and then you will join my band 
of thieves, the Gold Thief Army!

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.240
Join you?!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.610
That's right.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:06.320
I have heard many rumors 
of how you've been

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.980
defeating Death Generals.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.450
Taiki Kudou,

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.920
Kiriha Aonuma,

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.380
Nene Amano,

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:18.360
as well as Shoutmon and all the 
30 plus Digimon on your team.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.290
He knows us that well?

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.730
You are powerful opponents.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.460
So I came up with an idea.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:30.230
I only need to make you 
join my Gold Thief Army!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.640
Nonsense! We would never join you!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.250
Reload, Blue Flare!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.640
We'll crush you!

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.480
Hey, now, it's not such a bad offer.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:46.310
This Kingdom's flag lies under the sea.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:50.360
Without my pirate ship, 
you can't get to the next Kingdom.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.720
So that's it!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.890
Then we just have to steal his ship!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:06.970
Dual Tomahawk Boomerang!

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.320
Very well.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.390
If you're no better than that as fighters,

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.390
you can never join my crew.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:19.770
Mermaimon, take them on!

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.890
Aye-aye, Captain!

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.350
All right, boys, get them!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.430
Reload, Mervamon!

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.790
Sparrowmon!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.560
Looks like we've got a 
nasty woman on our hands.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:35.030
Wow, you're one to talk...

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:37.600
Taiki! Don't let us fall 
behind Kiriha and Nene!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.320
Yeah! Xros Heart is joining 
in full force, too!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.530
I'm counting on you all!

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:42.170
Reload!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.350
Starmons, time to DigiXros!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:49.110
Starmon!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:49.800
Yes!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:50.630
Pickmons!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:51.980
Yay!

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.580
DigiXros!

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.390
Star Sword!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.290
He's a Death General, all right.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.370
His strength isn't just for show.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.380
Yes, I am as strong as I look.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.530
But you all are stronger 
than you appear.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.880
Come on, join me!

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.230
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.110
You idiot! Quit playing around!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.390
Shoutmon, get inside and 
commandeer the ship!

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.670
Okay! Thanks!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.040
He has more buddies in here?

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.510
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.810
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:39.350
What?!

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.700
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:44.220
Spadamon, Lunamon, Coronamon...

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:47.610
Didn't I save all of 
you guys once before?!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.210
What?!

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:54.150
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:57.100
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.180
We're part of Olegmon's Gold Thief Army.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.450
We've awakened to our true spirits.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.300
Now the age of the bad kids will begin!

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.660
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:10.290
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.560
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.970
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.970
Stop saying that weird chant!

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.430
All right, everyone, all together!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:20.410
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.140
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.140
What is this?!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.580
I feel lightheaded...

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.350
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.280
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.410
Viva Olegna...

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:32.570
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.910
Now is the time.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.790
You will all be judged together!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.330
Viking Vuffet!

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.460
Knight!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.920
Shoutmon! Everyone!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.030
Now, everyone recite it together!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:54.230
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:57.500
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.830
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.650
Are you okay, Shoutmon?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.120
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:04.120
Don't worry about me.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.440
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.830
I'm starting to think 
joining the Gold Thief Army

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.720
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.720
will get me closer to 
becoming Digimon King.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.650
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:15.650
What?!

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.540
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.770
G-Greymon, you too?!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.770
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.470
Be careful, everyone!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.200
There's something dangerous 
about this incantation!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.840
You just can't help wanting 
to say it, can you?

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:29.540
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.080
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.950
Ah, I'm so tired!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.500
I'm sick of playing the good little boy!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.920
Wh-What did you say?!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.650
Nene's too scary. 
It's time to say goodbye.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.870
I always did think that 
even her hairstyle is weird.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.360
S-Sparrowmon...

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.550
He took our friends?

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:58.520
That's right. Friends are a man's 
greatest treasure, after all.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:03.190
In this world made of gold, 
there's no greater treasure than friends.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.920
You agree, don't you, Taiki?

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:09.190
I'm sure we would get along well.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:09.680
Right?

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:11.260
Kiriha, he's...

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:15.010
Yeah. He acts like a joker, 
but he's a powerful opponent.

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.660
We're losing the very core of our team.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.210
We've got to regroup somehow!

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:20.330
Nene! Huh?!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.690
Is it true? Is my hair weird?

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.650
Actually, I always thought it 
was sort of a bold style...

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.460
But nobody ever said anything to me...

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.860
Hey! What are you looking at?!

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:34.080
Cutemon's gone bad!

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.910
And I'm breaking down for other reasons!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:40.380
You all hurry up and join my army, too!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.900
Taiki, run away from here!

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:45.720
R-Right!

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.320
Nene, we're getting out of here!

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.120
MailBirdramon! Are you okay?

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.420
Yeah, somehow.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.550
Just give up trying to resist!

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.860
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:58.000
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.000
I won't let you past me!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.000
What?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.310
Why isn't the incantation working?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.990
<i>It can't be... It is! He's...</i>

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.770
Everyone, return!

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:14.450
It's not working. 
The ones he's captured won't come.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.550
Our team is a wreck right now.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.020
We have no choice but to pull back.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.220
Everyone...

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.800
Looks like you let them 
get away, Captain.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:27.690
It's all right.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.280
I got all these new allies.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.200
Besides...

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:37.870
I found the one great treasure 
that I've been looking for.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.230
Find them!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.880
Don't worry if you have to 
destroy those pesky houses!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.320
Help!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.070
Run!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:04.560
I-I don't know anyone like that!

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.880
Well, if you see them, let me know.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.400
Got that?

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.910
I'll just quietly take that...

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:21.210
So that's what's going 
on in this Kingdom?

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:25.140
That Olegmon acts merry, 
but he really is cruel.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.570
Not only that, he's sharp, too.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.290
If we take him on carelessly, 
he'll take more of our teammates.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.470
That incantation is the problem.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:37.090
How are those words able 
to manipulate everyone?

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.860
There are two points to consider.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.730
The first is that it 
doesn't work on humans.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:47.070
The other is that it didn't 
work on Ballistamon.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:51.610
It may be that it doesn't work 
well on machine types like him.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:55.730
Then we should attack with 
Cyberdramon at the front line.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.520
He's as close as it gets 
to being a machine.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:04.490
Shoutmon...

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:09.730
This scenery looks familiar...

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.270
Ballistamon.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.500
You're worried about 
Shoutmon, aren't you?

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.800
He's your best friend, after all.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.010
I still remember clearly

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.470
the day you first came 
to the Village of Smiles.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.340
I'll never forget it, either.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:38.110
I awoke in the village 
and Shoutmon saved me.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:42.670
We've been friends ever since then.

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:47.370
Don't worry. Your friendship 
can't be broken by any pirate.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.630
Thank you, Lillymon.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.370
Watch out!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.700
There's trouble! The enemy is here!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.240
Ballistamon is fighting them!

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:57.780
They're here?!

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:58.630
Let's go!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.160
Come on, Nene! Let's go!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.580
R-Right...

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.920
This is no time to be moping!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.030
Cyber Blader!

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:21.830
That's the way, everyone!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.780
Cutemon!

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.670
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.910
Don't whisper that in my ear!

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:35.100
Finish it!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.280
Death Divi—

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.520
Olegmon!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:45.120
My Gold Thief Army has arrived!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:49.530
Now then, perhaps I'll test the 
skills of my new crew members.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.260
Dorulumon!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.700
Gappo, Gappo!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.230
Oh, no! When did he...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:57.440
Darkness Loader DigiXros!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.190
Glutton Fang!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:08.420
This is another unusual Digimon.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:11.170
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.950
Gappo, Gappo...

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.860
No! I thought it wouldn't 
work on Cyberdramon!

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.960
Eraser Claw!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:25.910
Knock 'em senseless!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.480
Take 'em down!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.070
Here comes the final blow!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:32.920
Shoutmon, stop!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.350
Why, that little...

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.730
That little...

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.510
Let me go! What do you 
think you're doing?!

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:45.650
The same thing you did for me!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:49.130
You stopped me, Shoutmon!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.060
You fixed me!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.600
<i>I'll stop him.</i>

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.310
<i>Fool! It's too dangerous!</i>

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.470
<i>That Digimon is not in his right mind!</i>

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:04.570
<i>Can't you see it?! He's in pain!</i>

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.670
<i>He wants someone to help!</i>

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.470
<i>How can I leave him?</i>

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:16.180
You fought with all 
your might to stop me.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.670
Then you fixed me.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.780
I owe you my life, Shoutmon.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.510
I'm going to do the same for you.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:26.020
Because you're my friend.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.530
Y-You little...

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.090
Rowdy Rocker!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.030
Time to finish you!

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.240
Why won't you fall?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.750
Because you didn't fall, either.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:11.850
<i>All right! He's fixed!</i>

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.540
What are you doing, Shoutmon?! Get him!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:19.760
What are our magic words?

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.690
Gappo, Gappo... Viva Olegna...

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.580
Gappo, Ga—

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.450
Resist it! Remember!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:30.070
No, forget!

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:33.120
We of the Gold Thief Army 
are your new friends!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.480
Remember!

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:36.930
Forget!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:40.800
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.110
Shut up!

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:45.940
Shut up with the "Gappo, Gappo" crap!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.190
They've stopped moving!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.910
That's it! I get it now!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.190
Taiki, it's a musical scale!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:56.880
A musical scale?

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.780
We can save Shoutmon and the 
others with BalliBastemon!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.610
Really?! All right!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.370
Ballistamon! Bastemon!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.370
DigiXros!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.690
BalliBastemon!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:13.360
Sonic Dancing!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.060
Take that!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:30.420
Huh? What were we doing?

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.050
Figured it out, eh?

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.420
I am impressed.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:36.740
That incantation was actually 
a specialized musical scale.

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:39.250
Olegmon uses his four horns to amplify

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.400
the Digital power of his own sound,

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:45.760
creating vibrations in the air 
and rewriting Digimon's programs.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:48.030
That's why everyone 
turned into bad Digimon?

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:50.600
Shoutmon's incidental attack

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:53.240
disrupted the reverberation 
of his horns.

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.670
That's how I figured it out.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:59.580
Ballistamon... I attacked you, 
and Taiki and the others...

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:03.550
It's all right. 
That wasn't the real Shoutmon.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.920
Sorry.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:08.260
How dare you make friends 
fight with each other?!

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.330
I won't forgive you, Olegmon!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.070
Taiki!

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.230
Shoutmon! Digivolve!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.900
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.740
OmegaShoutmon!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.560
So that's the power 
they call Digivolution?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:29.540
Interesting!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.760
Here I come!

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:36.180
Hard Rock Damashi!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.050
Dual Tomahawk Boomerang!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.620
Beat Slash!

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.410
Viking Vuffet!

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:50.910
What?

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.270
You are very perceptive.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.280
<i>This is bad. He still has 
something else up his sleeve.</i>

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.140
<i>If I'm too careless, I'm done for.</i>

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:05.480
Plus, you turned out 
to be the perfect lure.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:09.430
Thanks to you, I found the 
greatest treasure of all.

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:12.680
Ballistamon!

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:16.020
Okay, Captain!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.090
Stop it! What are you 
doing to Ballistamon?!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:23.130
What I do with my own 
things is my choice.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.000
Stop taking people's friends already!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.500
That's where you're wrong.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.830
He was one of my men to start with.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.240
I made him!

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.710
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:44.350
Ballistamon was...

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:46.770
...an enemy?

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:49.220
That... That can't be...

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.170
Oh, yes, it can.

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:54.130
It's a happy reunion 
surpassing space and time!

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:55.940
Now, reawaken!

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:59.340
The ultimate destructive weapon 
that amplifies my power,

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:00.610
DarkVolumon!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:06.510
Ballistamon!

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:09.760
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:13.280
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.280
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:17.220
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:17.220
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:15.230
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.230
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:17.220
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:34.570
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:39.640
<b>Beast Man Type</b>

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:34.530
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:39.640
<b>King Lion Slash  
Flash Bancho Punch</b>

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:28.390
BanchoLeomon.

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:30.870
His attack is Flash Bancho Punch.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:34.520
A true man among men who always 
sees his own justice through!

00:22:34.520 --> 00:22:36.300
How cool!

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:39.640
Sort of reminds me of myself!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:43.380
Our friend, Ballistamon, 
has become an enemy?!

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:47.150
Sorry. I'm actually a bad Digimon.

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:49.680
Shoutmon! Defeat me!

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.480
Ballistamon!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:52.580
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.470
<b>Olegmon the Gold Thief Laughs!</b>

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.470
<b>Farewell, Xros Heart!</b>

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.520
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
